danos-open (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release
  * DPA API v0.1 with capability discovery and transaction model
  * Core engine: object registry, state store, transaction, event bus, reconciler
  * FIB adapter: ZAPI v6 parser and DPA mapper
  * VPP backend: capability advertisement and object mapper
  * Management plane: CLI and gNMI-like REST/JSON server
  * YANG models: interface, route, vrf, acl, qos, bfd
  * 33 unit tests + 11 conformance tests, all passing

